{"en":[{"partOfSpeech":"Symbol","language":"Translingual","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt5\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span><span about=\"#mwt5\"> </span><i about=\"#mwt5\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink/Interwiki\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO%20639-3\" title=\"w:ISO 639-3\" class=\"extiw\">ISO 639-3</a><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:ISO_639-3\"> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/language_code\" title=\"language code\">language code</a> for </i><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink/Interwiki\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO%20639:axe\" title=\"w:ISO 639:axe\" about=\"#mwt5\" class=\"extiw\"><b>Ayerrerenge</b></a><i about=\"#mwt5\">.</i>"}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/tool\" title=\"tool\">tool</a> for <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/fell\" title=\"fell\">felling</a> trees or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/chop\" title=\"chop\">chopping</a> wood etc. consisting of a heavy <!-- [[metallic]] (material is not essential, the axes used to be of stone in the stone age --> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/head\" title=\"head\">head</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/flatten\" title=\"flatten\">flattened</a> to a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/blade\" title=\"blade\">blade</a> on one side, and a <!-- usually wooden (material is not essential) --> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/handle\" title=\"handle\">handle</a> attached to it."},{"definition":"An <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/ancient\" title=\"ancient\">ancient</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/weapon\" title=\"weapon\">weapon</a> consisting of a <!-- [[metallic]] --> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/head\" title=\"head\">head</a> that has one or two <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/blade\" title=\"blade\">blades</a> and a long <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/handle\" title=\"handle\">handle</a>."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt32\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/dismissal\" title=\"dismissal\">dismissal</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/rejection\" title=\"rejection\">rejection</a>.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"His girlfriend<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">/</span>boss<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">/</span>schoolmaster gave him the <b>axe</b>."}],"examples":["His girlfriend<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">/</span>boss<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">/</span>schoolmaster gave him the <b>axe</b>."]},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt35\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/drastic\" title=\"drastic\">drastic</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/reduction\" title=\"reduction\">reduction</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/cutback\" title=\"cutback\">cutback</a>.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink/Interwiki\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beeching%20cuts\" title=\"w:Beeching cuts\" class=\"extiw\">Beeching <b>Axe</b></a>"},{"example":"The tractor plant is slated for the <b>axe</b>."}],"examples":["the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink/Interwiki\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beeching%20cuts\" title=\"w:Beeching cuts\" class=\"extiw\">Beeching <b>Axe</b></a>","The tractor plant is slated for the <b>axe</b>."]},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt41\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/gig\" title=\"gig\">gigging</a> musician's particular instrument, especially a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/guitar\" title=\"guitar\">guitar</a> in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/rock\" title=\"rock\">rock</a> music or a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/saxophone\" title=\"saxophone\">saxophone</a> in jazz."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt42\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A position, interest, or reason in buying and selling <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/stock\" title=\"stock\">stock</a>, often with ulterior motives.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"A financial dealer has an <b>axe</b> in a stock that his buyers don't know about, giving him an advantage in making the most profit."}],"examples":["A financial dealer has an <b>axe</b> in a stock that his buyers don't know about, giving him an advantage in making the most profit."]}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Verb","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt79\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/fell\" title=\"fell\">fell</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/chop\" title=\"chop\">chop</a> with an <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/axe#Noun\" class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\">axe</a>."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt80\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/lay_off\" title=\"lay off\">lay off</a>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/terminate\" title=\"terminate\">terminate</a> or drastically <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/reduce\" title=\"reduce\">reduce</a>, especially in a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/rough\" title=\"rough\">rough</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/ruthless\" title=\"ruthless\">ruthless</a> manner; to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/cancel\" title=\"cancel\">cancel</a>.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"The government announced its plans to <b>axe</b> public spending."},{"example":"The broadcaster <b>axed</b> the series because far fewer people than expected watched it."},{"example":"He got <b>axed</b> in the last round of firings."}],"examples":["The government announced its plans to <b>axe</b> public spending.","The broadcaster <b>axed</b> the series because far fewer people than expected watched it.","He got <b>axed</b> in the last round of firings."]}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-